<title>USA: CONN. RSD 16, WON BY ROOSEVELT &amp; CROSS.</title>
<headline>CONN. RSD 16, WON BY ROOSEVELT &amp; CROSS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross said it won $1.675 million of Connecticut Regional School District 16 (Beacon Falls and Prospect), Conn., general obligation bonds, issue 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.70 percent.</p>
